         <ieeecs:SectionTitle>Green Computing</ieeecs:SectionTitle>
         <ieeecs:Abstract>Adopting a holistic approach to greening IT is our responsibility toward creating a more sustaining environment.</ieeecs:Abstract>
         <ieeecs:ArticleTitle>Harnessing Green IT: Principles and Practices</ieeecs:ArticleTitle>
         <ieeecs:Keywords>Green IT, environmental computing, green computing, energy consumption, data centers, energy conservation, recycle, refurbish, enterprise green IT, Epeat, Energy Star 4.0 Standard, RoHS directive, IT environmental sustainability, and IT green awareness.</ieeecs:Keywords>
